sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Manager
    participant UI as :ConsoleUI
    participant G as :Game
    participant HH as :HappyHour
    participant P as :PricingPolicy
    participant H as host:Host
    participant W as waiter:Waiter
    participant C as chef:Chef
    participant R as :Restaurant
    participant V as chloe:VIPCustomer
    participant O as :Order

    Note over M,O: Part A. Stage 3 victory run (scripts/stage3-victory.txt), turn 7: VIP Chloe (#35;3) arrives, the manager switches on Happy Hour, Chloe orders.

    loop for turn = 1 to 18, until game.isOver()
        UI->>+G: beginTurn()
        G->>G: arrivals.arrivingOn(7)
        G->>R: admit(chloe)
        G-->>-UI: ARRIVAL event (satisfaction 100)
        UI-->>M: dashboard and staff tasks
        opt [game.canStartHappyHour()]
            UI-->>M: happy hour now? [y/N]
            M->>UI: "y"  (manager choice)
            UI->>+G: startHappyHour()
            G->>HH: activate(7)
            G->>+HH: refresh(restaurant, 7)
            HH->>R: awaitingService()
            loop for each waiting customer
                HH->>V: recover(15)
            end
            HH-->>-G: refreshed customers
            G-->>-UI: ActionResult.done (2 turns left)
        end
        M->>UI: "seat 3 1"
        UI->>+G: direct(host, cmd)
        G->>+H: perform(cmd, ctx)
        H->>R: seat(chloe, table1)
        R->>V: seatAt(table1)
        H-->>-G: ActionResult.done
        G-->>-UI: done
        M->>UI: "order 3"
        UI->>+G: direct(waiter, cmd)
        G->>+W: perform(cmd, ctx)
        W->>V: chooseFrom(menu)
        V-->>W: Pasta
        W->>+P: quote(chloe, Pasta, 7)
        P->>V: billFor($18.00)
        V-->>P: $16.20 (VIP 10% off)
        P->>HH: adjust($16.20, 7)
        HH-->>P: $12.96 (20% off)
        P-->>-W: $12.96
        W->>R: placeOrder(chloe, Pasta, $12.96, 7)
        R->>O: «create»
        R->>V: placeOrder(order)
        W-->>-G: ActionResult.done
        G-->>-UI: done
        Note over P,O: Price locked at $12.96. Without the manager's Happy Hour choice it would be $16.20.
        M->>UI: "cook 3"
        UI->>G: direct(chef, cmd)
        G->>C: perform(cmd, ctx)
        C->>O: prepareUnit(7)
        Note over C,O: 1 of 2 units
        UI->>+G: endTurn()
        loop for each customer in awaitingService()
            G->>V: loseSatisfaction()
            Note over V: VIP loses 5: 100 to 95
        end
        G-->>-UI: events and scoreboard
    end
